8. 许可范围 / Scope of Permission

版权所有者授予的任何许可仅限于书面许可中明确规定的范围。
Any permission granted by the copyright holder is limited strictly to the scope specified in the written permission.

例如，如果版权所有者仅允许使用某一张图片，则该许可不自动扩展到其他图片、Artwork、源代码、网站设计、其他文件或其他项目。
For example, if permission is granted for one specific image, such permission does not automatically extend to other images, artwork, source code, website designs, files, or projects.

未经再次授权，不得扩大、转让或重新授权所获得的许可。
Permission may not be expanded, transferred, or sublicensed without additional authorization.

除非书面许可明确允许，否则获得许可的用户不得将相关内容再次授权给其他人。
Unless expressly permitted in writing, a person who receives permission may not sublicense the permitted content to another person.

